  "description": "The goal of osmenrich is to easily enrich geocoded data (latitude/longitude) with geographic features from OpenStreetMap (OSM). The main language of the package is R and this package is designed to work with the sf and osmdata packages for collecting and manipulating geodata.",
  "name": "osmenrich: enrich geocoded data using OpenStreetMap"
}